+The optional `SessionSnapshot.controlled` flag marks an externally authorized transport. The original text editor and send/stop actions remain available through that transport. Attachment intake, model and permission changes, command-menu entry, and queue editing are disabled until explicit adapters exist. Ordinary Sessions keep their existing controls. The transport, rather than this presentation flag, enforces every operation.
